    ],
    "sections_raw": [
      {
        "heading_raw": "Prerequisites",
        "body_raw": "Cha 13, werebat-kin."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "You can take the form of a bat whose appearance is static and cannot be changed each time you assume this form. You gain a +10 racial bonus on Disguise checks to appear as a bat. Changing from werebat-kin to bat shape is a standard action. This ability otherwise functions as beast shape II, and your ability scores change accordingly. If you wear a bat pelt (see page 31), you may choose to adopt a form resembling the bat whose skin you wear instead of your normal bat form."
      }
    ],
